+---
+id: dl-002-timestamps-come-from-an-injected-clock
+type: decision-log
+title: "Timestamps come from an injected clock"
+status: pending
+---
+
+<!-- decision-log body. `wingfoil memory add` copies this scaffold verbatim; `memory submit` replaces
+     these placeholder comments with real content and fills the required frontmatter fields. -->
+
+## Context
+Tasks need creation and change times, but the domain may not read the clock (r3).
+
+## Decision
+`createTaskList` takes a `clock` function returning an ISO-8601 string and calls it once per add or
+change. The public `createTodoList` in `src/index.ts`, outside the domain, defaults it to the system
+clock; tests pass a fake one.
+
+## Consequences
+Domain stays deterministic and testable. Tagging a task with a tag it already has, or untagging an
+absent one, still counts as a change and sets `updatedAt`.
