+status: pending
+---
+
+<!-- task body. `wingfoil memory add` copies this scaffold verbatim; `memory submit` replaces
+     these placeholder comments with real content and fills the required frontmatter fields. -->
+
+## What was done
+Every task now has `createdAt` and `updatedAt` (ISO-8601 date-times). They are equal when the task is
+added; complete, reopen, rename, tag and untag set `updatedAt` to the time of the change. A refused
+change leaves the task untouched. Tests added in `test/list.test.ts`.
